  package-lock.json,project
close_reason: "Pinned @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.5, pm-changelog 2026.9.2, and pm-ops 2026.9.5 as exact devDependencies. The changelog-date gate already asserted the unflagged heading differs from the flagged one, so 2026.9.2's bare ## <version> control still proves --date-from-version is load-bearing."
